WEBVTT

01:35.789 --> 01:40.650
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.580 --> 01:43.970
[Episode 37]

01:46.509 --> 01:48.120
If you don't agree to my terms,

01:48.120 --> 01:49.520
I'll die right here today

01:49.950 --> 01:51.680
along with the child in my womb!

01:51.759 --> 01:52.950
You're threatening me again!

01:52.950 --> 01:54.280
I'm just reminding you!

01:57.310 --> 01:57.759
Fine.

02:02.230 --> 02:03.000
Xia Jingyan!

02:03.090 --> 02:03.590
Don't.

02:11.120 --> 02:11.650
Alright.

02:12.680 --> 02:13.740
Put the knife down.

02:14.680 --> 02:15.360
Didn't you say

02:15.360 --> 02:16.870
what's between us is just a deal?

02:16.870 --> 02:17.520
Then I will make

02:17.520 --> 02:18.850
one final deal with you.

02:19.960 --> 02:21.490
My birthday is coming soon.

02:22.190 --> 02:24.320
Stay with me until my birthday is over,

02:24.360 --> 02:24.910
and I will

02:25.530 --> 02:26.880
give you a border pass

02:29.440 --> 02:30.640
and let you all leave.

02:30.870 --> 02:31.910
Is that all?

02:37.630 --> 02:38.280
Good.

02:39.550 --> 02:40.610
Then it's a deal.

02:42.079 --> 02:42.590
But first of all,

02:42.590 --> 02:44.450
I need to see my brother tomorrow.

02:46.520 --> 02:47.030
Okay.

02:47.800 --> 02:50.070
I'm going to visit
my ancestral residence tomorrow,

02:50.070 --> 02:51.930
and I'll allow you to see him then.

02:52.079 --> 02:52.750
However,

02:54.710 --> 02:56.079
don't ever think about seeing your brother

02:56.079 --> 02:57.960
and using that chance to flee away.

02:57.960 --> 02:59.030
This is Jinxiu,

02:59.520 --> 03:00.780
the city under my rule,

03:01.080 --> 03:02.340
and you cannot escape.

03:03.310 --> 03:05.190
Neither do I want to harm Feng Suige.

03:05.190 --> 03:06.990
But if you do something foolish,

03:07.840 --> 03:09.440
you know what I'm capable of.

03:32.690 --> 03:34.040
Xia Jingyan made her

03:34.430 --> 03:35.000
settle down

03:35.000 --> 03:36.560
in a palace of the harem.

03:37.310 --> 03:38.040
It's said...

03:41.630 --> 03:42.840
It's said that Empress Dowager Jing

03:42.840 --> 03:43.870
has had several fights

03:43.870 --> 03:46.000
with Xia Jingyan
because of Princess Xiyang.

03:46.000 --> 03:47.000
As far as I can see,

03:47.190 --> 03:48.280
at least Xia Jingyan is

03:48.280 --> 03:49.810
on Princess Xiyang's side.

03:50.000 --> 03:51.840
She should be safe for now.

03:53.750 --> 03:56.560
I'm going to kill Xia Jingshi.

03:58.750 --> 03:59.470
Feng Suige,

04:00.020 --> 04:01.440
you must stay calm.

04:04.000 --> 04:05.750
I was the one who handed

04:05.750 --> 04:06.950
my sister over to him.

04:08.280 --> 04:10.000
I've always known

04:10.000 --> 04:12.030
that Xiyang wouldn't be happy
marrying him.

04:12.030 --> 04:13.120
And I never expected

04:13.120 --> 04:14.520
him to make Xiyang happy.

04:15.590 --> 04:17.320
My sister cares for him so much.

04:18.269 --> 04:20.120
For him, she was willing to abandon Susha

04:20.120 --> 04:21.920
and betray her father and brother.

04:21.920 --> 04:23.120
She even threatened to commit suicide

04:23.120 --> 04:24.980
just to help him out of his misery.

04:25.720 --> 04:26.780
But what about him?

04:28.000 --> 04:29.560
He's ungrateful.

04:30.950 --> 04:33.610
Xia Jingshi doesn't deserve
to be called human.

04:34.390 --> 04:36.750
I will tear him to pieces.

04:37.430 --> 04:38.000
Yes,

04:38.750 --> 04:40.350
Xia Jingshi deserves to die.

04:40.390 --> 04:41.310
But we're in Jinxiu,

04:41.310 --> 04:42.159
not Susha.

04:42.800 --> 04:43.870
Also, we're here

04:44.070 --> 04:45.310
to rescue Princess Xiyang

04:45.310 --> 04:46.310
from her predicament,

04:46.310 --> 04:47.830
not to put you in danger.

04:48.600 --> 04:49.530
Calm down first.

04:49.690 --> 04:51.350
We can surely figure out a way.

04:51.680 --> 04:52.920
Xia Jingyan refuses to see you

04:52.920 --> 04:53.560
and must have

04:53.560 --> 04:54.310
kept your arrival

04:54.310 --> 04:55.570
in Jinxiu under wraps.

04:55.680 --> 04:56.610
But don't worry.

04:57.159 --> 04:58.510
I've already told Pei

04:58.870 --> 05:00.390
to inform Princess Xiyang

05:00.750 --> 05:01.880
of your rescue plan.

05:02.680 --> 05:03.160
Okay.

05:04.310 --> 05:06.950
Xiyang has led a luxurious life
since childhood.

05:06.950 --> 05:09.610
She's never suffered
such humiliation before.

05:09.830 --> 05:11.630
No one knows her better than I do.

05:12.310 --> 05:14.070
She appears gentle on the surface,

05:14.070 --> 05:15.950
but she's actually quite tough inside.

05:15.950 --> 05:17.510
Having endured all this,

05:18.000 --> 05:20.400
she must be planning
to take revenge for me.

05:20.750 --> 05:21.390
That's why

05:21.920 --> 05:23.250
you must trust her, too.

05:23.750 --> 05:25.160
If she receives the message,

05:25.160 --> 05:25.920
she'll surely find a way

05:25.920 --> 05:26.800
to meet with us.

05:30.120 --> 05:30.980
Your Highness.

05:31.360 --> 05:32.220
Your Highness,

05:32.390 --> 05:33.870
the Ministry of Rites told us

05:33.870 --> 05:34.430
that the Princess

05:34.430 --> 05:35.600
will come to see you tomorrow

05:35.600 --> 05:36.920
right at the Yunlai Inn.

05:36.920 --> 05:38.120
Princess Xiyang must have

05:38.120 --> 05:39.430
received our message already.

05:39.430 --> 05:40.190
Anyway,

05:40.950 --> 05:42.610
let's meet with Xiyang first.

05:43.270 --> 05:44.830
You've waited for so long.

05:45.270 --> 05:46.430
Have a little more patience

05:46.430 --> 05:48.030
and wait just one more night.

05:48.240 --> 05:48.920
Soon,

05:49.680 --> 05:50.240
you will be able

05:50.240 --> 05:51.300
to see your sister.

06:06.840 --> 06:08.950
Can't believe you've been through so much.

06:08.950 --> 06:09.750
But Yixiao,

06:10.080 --> 06:10.940
no matter what,

06:11.480 --> 06:12.940
you are still from Jinxiu.

06:13.000 --> 06:14.190
Jinxiu is your home.

06:14.920 --> 06:15.870
If one day

06:16.270 --> 06:18.070
Susha and Jinxiu go to war again,

06:19.120 --> 06:20.310
how will you choose?

06:22.460 --> 06:24.520
The former Fu Yixiao is already dead.

06:25.040 --> 06:26.970
It was Feng Suige who kept me alive.

06:28.040 --> 06:29.160
The old Fu Yixiao

06:29.510 --> 06:30.970
risked her life for Jinxiu

06:31.750 --> 06:33.210
with nothing to repent of.

06:34.100 --> 06:35.080
Xiyang,

06:35.480 --> 06:37.100
your brother has come to pick you up.

06:37.100 --> 06:38.970
Tomorrow, I will take you home.

06:43.120 --> 06:44.420
So it was all

06:44.750 --> 06:46.510
my wishful thinking,

06:47.480 --> 06:48.830
my one-sided love.

06:52.950 --> 06:53.950
"Shi'an" is good.

06:55.870 --> 06:57.000
"Shiyou" is better,

06:58.030 --> 07:00.430
suitable for both princes and princesses.

07:02.270 --> 07:02.750
Am I still

07:02.750 --> 07:04.610
the Princess of Susha I used to be?

07:06.190 --> 07:06.950
Brother,

07:08.390 --> 07:10.120
am I still your younger sister?

07:11.830 --> 07:12.430
Yixiao,

07:13.360 --> 07:13.920
do you know

07:13.920 --> 07:16.120
that I've been scheming all these years

07:16.560 --> 07:17.920
just for this day?

07:20.680 --> 07:21.360
Xiyang,

07:22.000 --> 07:24.000
no matter how much you've suffered,

07:24.390 --> 07:25.270
I will

07:25.270 --> 07:27.360
settle the score for you one by one.

07:29.160 --> 07:30.960
My hands are stained with blood.

07:32.040 --> 07:34.070
I'm no longer who I used to be.

07:35.510 --> 07:36.270
Brother,

07:37.600 --> 07:39.930
I don't deserve to be your sister anymore.

07:40.270 --> 07:41.840
It's just a deal.

07:42.000 --> 07:43.430
I don't care about it either!

07:43.430 --> 07:44.159
Feng Xiyang,

07:44.270 --> 07:46.000
I have no concern for you at all!

07:47.070 --> 07:47.790
Yixiao,

07:48.390 --> 07:49.360
wait for me.

07:49.830 --> 07:51.430
Wait until I finish all this,

07:51.920 --> 07:53.850
and I will bring you back to my side.

07:54.210 --> 07:55.780
From now on, I, Fu Yixiao,

07:56.630 --> 07:58.090
will only live for myself.

08:04.630 --> 08:06.310
Why don't you understand what I'm saying?

08:06.310 --> 08:08.070
The inn is closed.
We're not serving any guests.

08:08.070 --> 08:09.510
And do you understand me?

08:10.000 --> 08:11.360
I told you I'm not here to book any rooms.

08:11.360 --> 08:12.680
I'm looking for someone.

08:12.680 --> 08:13.830
I'm looking for someone about this tall,

08:13.830 --> 08:14.560
usually in red.

08:14.560 --> 08:15.560
-Ning Fei.
-Or...

08:17.240 --> 08:17.830
Yixiao.

08:20.720 --> 08:21.980
Ning Fei, you're here.

08:22.430 --> 08:23.090
Where are Xueying,

08:23.090 --> 08:23.920
Fang, and the others?

08:23.920 --> 08:24.510
How are they?

08:24.510 --> 08:25.450
Are they all doing well?

08:25.450 --> 08:26.650
Don't worry, Yixiao.

08:26.680 --> 08:27.680
They're all fine.

08:28.040 --> 08:28.640
By the way,

08:28.870 --> 08:30.240
Xueying asked me to tell you

08:30.240 --> 08:31.560
that she's tied up right now.

08:31.560 --> 08:32.630
After you wrap things up,

08:32.630 --> 08:34.030
you can go back to see her.

08:34.720 --> 08:35.620
You scared me.

08:35.960 --> 08:37.270
I'm glad they're all doing well.

08:37.270 --> 08:38.480
That puts my mind at ease.

08:38.480 --> 08:40.000
I was planning to settle down first,

08:40.000 --> 08:41.480
then go to Yujing City to help you.

08:41.480 --> 08:43.030
Fortunately, I received your reply

08:43.030 --> 08:44.390
and learned that you'd come to Shengjing.

08:44.390 --> 08:45.080
So I hurried here

08:45.080 --> 08:46.030
without delay

08:46.030 --> 08:47.090
to meet up with you.

08:51.600 --> 08:52.530
Long time no see.

08:53.000 --> 08:53.930
Long time no see.

08:55.670 --> 08:57.030
When you meet your sister later,

08:57.030 --> 08:58.200
remember not to act on impulse.

08:58.200 --> 08:59.390
Talk things through calmly.

08:59.390 --> 09:00.590
Don't make her worry.

09:02.600 --> 09:03.250
Actually,

09:03.630 --> 09:05.150
I haven't been
back to Shengjing for a while.

09:05.150 --> 09:06.030
Ning Fei and I

09:06.080 --> 09:07.610
will go out for a walk later.

09:07.750 --> 09:08.510
You and your sister haven't

09:08.510 --> 09:09.550
seen each other for a long time.

09:09.550 --> 09:11.350
You must have a lot to catch up on.

09:11.360 --> 09:12.820
I'll leave you two to talk.

09:13.390 --> 09:15.300
Be careful when you hang out.

09:15.550 --> 09:16.540
Stay safe.

09:17.200 --> 09:17.930
Don't worry.

09:18.270 --> 09:20.120
It's good
that Xiyang can come out to see you.

09:20.120 --> 09:21.020
Make her stay,

09:21.270 --> 09:22.200
and tomorrow morning,

09:22.200 --> 09:23.330
we'll take her away.

09:24.840 --> 09:25.440
All right.

09:31.000 --> 09:31.600
Yixiao,

09:32.550 --> 09:33.240
do you remember

09:33.240 --> 09:35.000
when we came to Shengjing once before?

09:35.000 --> 09:35.480
Yes.

09:36.390 --> 09:38.120
His Highness sent the three of us

09:38.120 --> 09:39.510
to meet someone in Shengjing.

09:39.510 --> 09:39.910
Right.

09:40.840 --> 09:41.870
Right on this street,

09:41.870 --> 09:42.510
the three of us

09:42.510 --> 09:43.910
feasted on a roast lamb together.

09:43.910 --> 09:44.710
It was so good.

09:45.480 --> 09:46.240
I wonder

09:47.030 --> 09:49.160
if that restaurant is still open here.

09:50.200 --> 09:51.200
Steamed buns.

10:00.030 --> 10:00.870
Xiao Weiran?

10:14.320 --> 10:14.770
Let's split up and search.

10:14.770 --> 10:15.260
Okay.

10:36.090 --> 10:43.850
[Yunlai Inn]

10:52.900 --> 10:55.230
[Yunlai Inn]

10:58.600 --> 10:59.460
Your Highness,

11:00.480 --> 11:01.080
please.

11:03.530 --> 11:08.000
[Yunlai Inn]

11:18.120 --> 11:18.980
Your Highness.

11:21.430 --> 11:22.290
Your Highness,

11:23.060 --> 11:25.260
the Prince is waiting for you upstairs.

11:32.110 --> 11:32.790
The Emperor of Jinxiu

11:32.790 --> 11:34.150
has brought a squad of soldiers with him,

11:34.150 --> 11:35.550
standing guard outside.

11:36.240 --> 11:37.120
Ignore them.

12:23.150 --> 12:23.750
Xiyang.

12:25.370 --> 12:26.440
Brother!

12:33.240 --> 12:35.720
I thought I would never see you again.

12:36.320 --> 12:37.870
I missed you so much.

12:38.840 --> 12:39.870
I thought I was

12:39.870 --> 12:41.150
left all alone

12:41.150 --> 12:42.790
in this world.

12:43.720 --> 12:46.320
Living that way was
more painful than dying.

12:46.750 --> 12:47.660
I know.

12:49.360 --> 12:50.270
I know, Xiyang.

12:51.790 --> 12:52.790
It's all over now.

12:53.510 --> 12:54.570
It's all behind us.

12:59.120 --> 13:00.630
See? I'm standing here

13:00.630 --> 13:02.090
safe and sound before you.

13:02.270 --> 13:02.870
Xiyang.

13:05.440 --> 13:07.480
I failed to well protect you.

13:07.600 --> 13:08.150
No.

13:08.630 --> 13:09.720
It was my fault.

13:10.150 --> 13:11.840
Brother, it was my fault.

13:12.670 --> 13:14.920
I was too headstrong, too foolish.

13:15.270 --> 13:17.290
I didn't listen to you back then.

13:17.440 --> 13:18.910
Everything that happened to me

13:18.910 --> 13:20.150
was my own doing.

13:20.150 --> 13:21.410
I brought it on myself.

13:21.720 --> 13:23.580
This is the punishment I deserve.

13:24.360 --> 13:26.020
Don't talk nonsense, Xiyang.

13:26.840 --> 13:28.910
Since hearing that terrible news,

13:29.990 --> 13:32.520
I've prayed to heaven every day.

13:33.440 --> 13:34.390
I begged God

13:34.390 --> 13:36.240
to show mercy and protect you.

13:37.510 --> 13:39.800
I wished it had been me who died instead.

13:40.360 --> 13:41.720
I would rather have

13:41.720 --> 13:43.800
all the suffering fall upon me.

13:44.150 --> 13:45.600
I don't want you

13:45.600 --> 13:47.330
to go through any danger again.

13:47.550 --> 13:48.910
It must've been your sincerity and piety

13:48.910 --> 13:50.120
that moved God.

13:50.480 --> 13:51.810
Throughout my journey,

13:51.910 --> 13:53.640
I escaped danger at every turn.

13:53.910 --> 13:55.310
See, I'm perfectly fine.

13:56.390 --> 13:57.910
I hate myself so much.

13:59.270 --> 14:01.320
I hate that I made you worry so much.

14:02.270 --> 14:04.200
I hate that I was so bewitched

14:04.200 --> 14:05.730
that I fell for Xia Jingshi.

14:07.200 --> 14:08.960
I hate that the last time I saw you,

14:08.960 --> 14:10.680
I broke your heart.

14:12.840 --> 14:13.750
Brother,

14:14.360 --> 14:15.390
I've made

14:15.870 --> 14:17.400
too many foolish mistakes.

14:18.000 --> 14:18.960
Not even my death

14:18.960 --> 14:20.550
can make up for them.

14:21.550 --> 14:23.960
You tried to make me see Xia Jingshi
for who he was.

14:23.960 --> 14:25.550
But I turned a deaf ear.

14:26.550 --> 14:27.550
I was such a fool that I thought

14:27.550 --> 14:28.960
I could change him.

14:30.000 --> 14:31.390
But later I realized

14:31.390 --> 14:32.870
how stupid I was.

14:33.390 --> 14:35.000
But by the time I woke up,

14:35.000 --> 14:36.670
it was already too late.

14:38.000 --> 14:39.860
If I had come to my senses earlier,

14:40.000 --> 14:41.840
I could have come back to you.

14:42.270 --> 14:43.120
At least when you

14:43.120 --> 14:44.750
went through all those things,

14:44.750 --> 14:46.620
I could have been by your side.

14:46.910 --> 14:48.750
But all I did was make you angry.

14:48.790 --> 14:51.200
I've never done anything for you.

14:51.440 --> 14:52.440
Listen to me.

14:53.080 --> 14:54.790
I have never blamed you.

14:55.840 --> 14:56.970
When you're with me,

14:57.270 --> 14:59.000
you can be willful; you can make mistakes;

14:59.000 --> 15:00.730
you can do anything as you like.

15:01.120 --> 15:03.080
Even if you make all hell break loose,

15:03.080 --> 15:04.480
I've still got your back.

15:04.840 --> 15:06.220
So let bygones

15:06.910 --> 15:07.790
be bygones.

15:08.910 --> 15:10.720
What matters most to me now

15:11.390 --> 15:12.840
is that you can come back to me

15:12.840 --> 15:13.840
safe and sound.

15:17.290 --> 15:19.470
♪ Flying alone ♪

15:19.680 --> 15:22.740
♪ With no need for direction ♪

15:20.360 --> 15:21.200
But...

15:24.240 --> 15:25.630
There's no going back.

15:25.040 --> 15:27.210
♪ Flying up to the clouds ♪

15:27.270 --> 15:28.600
It's too late.

15:27.600 --> 15:30.150
♪ Yet the sun is hiding ♪

15:29.510 --> 15:29.840
I...

15:29.840 --> 15:31.700
I don't deserve to be your sister.

15:32.200 --> 15:34.000
What nonsense
are you talking about, Xiyang?

15:32.710 --> 15:34.630
♪ Roaming freely ♪

15:34.630 --> 15:36.080
My hands are stained with blood.

15:34.870 --> 15:38.220
♪ Unafraid of wind or frost ♪

15:38.090 --> 15:39.580
I've become a villain.

15:40.190 --> 15:41.960
♪ The wet wings ♪

15:40.720 --> 15:41.600
I was like a madwoman

15:41.600 --> 15:43.220
when I gave myself to Xia Jingyan.

15:42.290 --> 15:46.970
♪ Will carry me far away ♪

15:46.150 --> 15:48.600
I'm no longer who I used to be.

15:48.670 --> 15:49.510
In my eyes,

15:49.600 --> 15:51.360
you will always be my little sister.

15:51.360 --> 15:51.870
No!

15:51.450 --> 15:54.440
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

15:52.890 --> 15:54.150
You don't understand.

15:55.320 --> 15:56.800
I made a mistake.

15:56.910 --> 15:59.500
I'm carrying Xia Jingyan's child!

16:07.170 --> 16:12.530
♪ I'll remember the way home ♪

16:16.190 --> 16:20.320
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

16:20.150 --> 16:20.870
Brother,

16:22.290 --> 16:27.640
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

16:23.910 --> 16:25.000
I was wrong.

16:28.240 --> 16:30.100
I don't deserve to be your sister.

16:31.030 --> 16:35.080
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

16:32.960 --> 16:34.820
I don't deserve to be your sister.

16:35.630 --> 16:36.200
Xiyang,

16:36.840 --> 16:37.870
Xiyang, listen to me.

16:37.530 --> 16:42.890
♪ I'll remember the way home ♪

16:38.480 --> 16:40.010
No matter what's happened,

16:40.910 --> 16:42.040
whether in the past,

16:42.120 --> 16:43.550
present, or future,

16:43.720 --> 16:45.150
no matter what you've become,

16:44.510 --> 16:47.070
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

16:46.720 --> 16:47.960
you will always be

16:48.030 --> 16:49.480
my little sister.

16:48.030 --> 16:50.960
♪ Don't cry ♪

16:51.910 --> 16:52.960
Xia Jingshi

16:52.410 --> 16:57.860
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

16:53.720 --> 16:54.840
and Xia Jingyan...

16:55.670 --> 16:56.510
I won't

16:56.510 --> 16:58.390
let either of them go.

16:59.020 --> 17:06.760
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

16:59.150 --> 17:01.080
For all the pain and suffering

17:02.200 --> 17:03.130
you've endured,

17:03.630 --> 17:05.640
I will make them pay back

17:05.680 --> 17:07.069
a thousand times over.

17:07.720 --> 17:08.200
No.

17:08.589 --> 17:09.119
Brother,

17:09.640 --> 17:10.880
don't do anything.

17:11.510 --> 17:12.440
I don't want to get you

17:12.440 --> 17:13.680
into any more danger.

17:15.069 --> 17:16.640
Having seen you again,

17:17.680 --> 17:19.480
nothing else matters to me now.

17:26.720 --> 17:27.750
I'm missing home.

17:31.590 --> 17:32.680
I didn't even get

17:32.680 --> 17:34.400
to see Father one last time.

17:35.750 --> 17:36.350
I know.

17:39.750 --> 17:41.030
I know it all.

17:42.750 --> 17:43.960
Rest for tonight.

17:44.750 --> 17:47.080
When the city gates open at dawn tomorrow,

17:47.310 --> 17:48.750
I'll take you home.

17:58.550 --> 17:59.750
Don't worry, Xiyang.

18:01.110 --> 18:02.310
Come what may,

18:03.240 --> 18:04.880
I'll always be by your side.

18:22.750 --> 18:24.550
You should cherish this second chance

18:24.550 --> 18:26.010
at life you've been given.

18:26.480 --> 18:27.810
Why were you tailing me?

18:30.900 --> 18:31.940
Xiao Weiran,

18:32.550 --> 18:33.880
are you going to kill me?

18:36.490 --> 18:37.750
We were like brothers.

18:38.550 --> 18:39.680
Don't force my hand.

18:41.240 --> 18:42.000
So there's finally a day

18:42.000 --> 18:44.310
when you, Xiao Weiran,
can't bring yourself to act.

18:44.310 --> 18:45.840
You're not worthy of saying

18:46.240 --> 18:47.030
"brother."

19:04.000 --> 19:05.860
Do we, the Three Heroes of Jinxiu,

19:06.240 --> 19:08.040
have to turn against each other?

19:08.070 --> 19:10.730
How dare you mention
the Three Heroes of Jinxiu?

19:11.070 --> 19:13.330
Weren't you the first to draw your blade?

19:24.590 --> 19:26.240
What are you doing in Shengjing City?

19:26.240 --> 19:27.500
None of your business.

19:28.790 --> 19:30.510
Feng Suige is also here, right?

19:30.510 --> 19:32.370
I guess it's for Princess Xiyang.

19:36.480 --> 19:37.110
Though I don't know

19:37.110 --> 19:38.570
what you've been through,

19:39.070 --> 19:40.440
we grew up together,

19:41.200 --> 19:43.270
and with just one look from you,
I can tell

19:43.270 --> 19:43.930
that you're

19:44.200 --> 19:46.060
no longer the Ning Fei I once knew.

19:46.640 --> 19:47.880
But I can also tell

19:49.030 --> 19:49.640
that you're still

19:49.640 --> 19:51.370
the same Xiao Weiran as before,

19:51.480 --> 19:52.510
still stubbornly

19:52.510 --> 19:54.510
following your master, the Prince.

19:56.400 --> 19:57.130
You're not

19:58.110 --> 20:00.110
going to talk me out of this, are you?

20:00.240 --> 20:01.500
You're overthinking.

20:02.200 --> 20:03.240
You're hopeless

20:03.240 --> 20:04.300
and beyond saving.

20:04.750 --> 20:06.410
I won't waste my breath on you.

20:08.030 --> 20:09.230
Where is Xia Jingshi?

20:13.270 --> 20:14.870
Tell me where Xia Jingshi is.

20:15.550 --> 20:16.680
What is he plotting?

20:17.270 --> 20:18.560
I know him well.

20:19.110 --> 20:21.200
Enduring all this
and staying in Shengjing,

20:21.200 --> 20:22.660
he must be up to something.

20:23.400 --> 20:24.070
You shouldn't have

20:24.070 --> 20:25.400
come to Shengjing City.

20:26.480 --> 20:28.210
But since you're already here,

20:28.580 --> 20:30.780
just stay out of it and don't ask around.

20:31.960 --> 20:34.070
Xiao Weiran, you're implying something.

20:34.070 --> 20:35.600
You're concerned about us.

20:39.000 --> 20:40.530
Don't read too much into it.

20:41.350 --> 20:42.680
I just want to advise you

20:44.480 --> 20:46.480
to stop going against His Highness.

20:46.680 --> 20:47.160
You've all

20:47.160 --> 20:48.160
died once before.

20:48.640 --> 20:50.040
Don't court death again.

20:50.590 --> 20:52.000
So in your heart,

20:52.830 --> 20:54.360
we're always your enemies.

20:55.000 --> 20:56.200
Isn't that the truth?

21:08.270 --> 21:09.070
You may leave.

21:10.270 --> 21:11.590
Your encounter with us today

21:11.590 --> 21:13.050
was purely a coincidence.

21:13.440 --> 21:15.640
There's no old bond to reminisce about.

21:18.200 --> 21:18.860
Never mind.

21:20.720 --> 21:21.590
From now on,

21:23.640 --> 21:25.370
we'll split up like strangers.

21:38.240 --> 21:39.770
What else do you want to say?

21:40.830 --> 21:42.370
It's not safe in Shengjing City.

21:42.370 --> 21:43.830
Leave as soon as possible.

21:47.260 --> 21:48.050
Weiran...

21:48.160 --> 21:48.620
Let's go.

21:48.620 --> 21:50.120
Hurry back to find Feng Suige.

21:50.120 --> 21:51.580
Something big is about to happen
in Shengjing City.

21:51.580 --> 21:52.110
Alright.

21:56.070 --> 21:56.640
Tong,

21:58.070 --> 21:58.720
go get Xiyang

21:58.720 --> 21:59.800
a new pillow.

21:59.960 --> 22:01.220
She prefers soft ones.

22:02.000 --> 22:02.630
Also,

22:03.000 --> 22:04.090
go ask Yu Qi

22:04.160 --> 22:06.330
for a sachet with turmeric fragrance

22:06.590 --> 22:07.750
to put under her pillow.

22:07.750 --> 22:08.200
Yes.

22:08.350 --> 22:09.310
Your Highness, please rest assured,

22:09.310 --> 22:10.440
I'll keep it in mind.

22:10.920 --> 22:11.520
You may go.

22:16.920 --> 22:17.550
Brother,

22:18.480 --> 22:20.270
you actually remember all these details.

22:20.270 --> 22:20.960
Of course.

22:21.750 --> 22:23.310
Just stay here and take it easy.

22:23.310 --> 22:24.440
Don't overthink things.

22:24.440 --> 22:25.300
Just rest well.

22:26.790 --> 22:27.760
Seeing you

22:28.350 --> 22:30.160
just puts my mind at ease.

22:31.720 --> 22:33.380
And I start to feel a bit tired.

22:34.920 --> 22:36.580
Then get some good rest first.

22:36.590 --> 22:37.790
I'll leave you alone.

22:59.970 --> 23:03.030
[Hidden Dragon Mansion]

23:36.830 --> 23:37.430
[Hidden Dragon Mansion]

23:44.440 --> 23:45.940
By order of the Empress Dowager,

23:45.940 --> 23:47.470
withdraw all the soldiers.

23:48.400 --> 23:48.930
Let's go.

23:49.680 --> 23:51.830
I'll be in charge of security here.

24:14.920 --> 24:16.230
You saw Xiao Weiran?

24:16.480 --> 24:17.600
He was in a hurry,

24:17.920 --> 24:19.550
definitely still working for Xia Jingshi.

24:19.550 --> 24:20.310
I asked him on purpose

24:20.310 --> 24:21.750
what Xia Jingshi was planning.

24:21.750 --> 24:22.920
I knew he wouldn't tell me.

24:22.920 --> 24:24.400
I just wanted to see his reaction.

24:24.400 --> 24:25.330
When I asked him,

24:25.480 --> 24:27.550
he unconsciously
avoided eye contact with me.

24:27.550 --> 24:29.400
That's what he usually does when he's

24:29.400 --> 24:30.460
hiding something.

24:30.550 --> 24:31.400
In this case,

24:32.070 --> 24:32.680
Xia Jingshi

24:32.680 --> 24:34.410
is indeed planning something.

24:34.830 --> 24:35.630
That's right.

24:35.720 --> 24:37.590
And the Emperor of Jinxiu, Xia Jingyan,

24:37.590 --> 24:39.070
takes pleasure in torturing Xia Jingshi.

24:39.070 --> 24:40.250
If Xia Jingshi were

24:40.350 --> 24:41.640
under his control,

24:41.880 --> 24:42.940
he would have Xia Jingshi present

24:42.940 --> 24:43.880
at his birthday celebration

24:43.880 --> 24:45.140
just to humiliate him.

24:45.310 --> 24:46.400
Xiao Weiran should be

24:46.400 --> 24:47.880
by Xia Jingshi's side right now.

24:47.880 --> 24:48.570
But today,

24:48.790 --> 24:50.250
he appeared on the street.

24:50.310 --> 24:51.440
If I'm not mistaken,

24:51.830 --> 24:52.960
Xia Jingshi has now

24:53.240 --> 24:53.880
broken loose

24:53.880 --> 24:55.310
from Xia Jingyan's control.

24:55.310 --> 24:56.890
Your analysis makes sense.

24:56.960 --> 24:58.020
So what do you think

24:58.270 --> 25:00.030
Xia Jingshi is planning?

25:00.110 --> 25:01.640
What Xia Jingshi wants most

25:01.720 --> 25:02.980
is to kill Xia Jingyan.

25:03.030 --> 25:04.000
During the Qianqiu Festival,

25:04.000 --> 25:05.680
Xia Jingyan will be
away from the imperial palace,

25:05.680 --> 25:07.400
making it his perfect chance to strike.

25:07.400 --> 25:08.110
Xiao Weiran told us

25:08.110 --> 25:09.440
to leave Shengjing quickly.

25:09.440 --> 25:10.070
He must know

25:10.070 --> 25:11.200
something big is about to happen.

25:11.200 --> 25:12.060
Your Highness!

25:12.440 --> 25:13.110
I was sending food

25:13.110 --> 25:13.850
to Princess Xiyang,

25:13.850 --> 25:14.710
but she's gone.

25:16.160 --> 25:17.160
The Princess said

25:17.400 --> 25:19.110
she had an agreement with that person

25:19.110 --> 25:20.640
that if she went to meet him,

25:20.920 --> 25:22.920
she could safely leave with you,
Your Highness.

25:22.920 --> 25:24.200
Hey, "that person"?

25:24.220 --> 25:25.370
Who is that person?

25:26.160 --> 25:27.750
Xia Jingyan.

25:28.350 --> 25:29.380
If Xia Jingshi

25:29.590 --> 25:31.650
plans to kill Xia Jingyan tonight...

25:32.240 --> 25:32.900
This is bad.

25:33.030 --> 25:34.690
Princess Xiyang is in danger.

26:19.000 --> 26:20.310
I've kept my promise

26:20.880 --> 26:22.810
to accompany you on your birthday.

26:24.820 --> 26:25.740
If you dare

26:25.920 --> 26:27.310
break our agreement,

26:27.880 --> 26:30.010
I will personally lead troops to Susha

26:30.400 --> 26:31.330
and get you back.

26:33.160 --> 26:34.720
You cannot escape my grasp.

26:37.920 --> 26:39.920
I hope you'll also keep your promise

26:40.240 --> 26:41.170
and let us leave.

26:43.710 --> 26:45.170
I asked you to stay with me,

26:45.710 --> 26:46.910
but I was just joking.

26:47.200 --> 26:48.840
You actually took it seriously.

26:48.840 --> 26:49.880
Do I lack women?

26:50.400 --> 26:51.000
Do you really think

26:51.000 --> 26:52.310
I can't bear to part with you?

26:52.310 --> 26:54.310
I don't care how much is true or fake,

26:54.830 --> 26:55.750
but I, Feng Xiyang,

26:55.750 --> 26:56.720
always keep

26:56.960 --> 26:57.920
my promises.

27:06.070 --> 27:07.030
Anyway,

27:07.830 --> 27:09.360
tomorrow is your birthday,

27:10.510 --> 27:12.030
so I wish you all the best.

27:21.720 --> 27:22.850
Wish me all the best?

27:25.480 --> 27:26.590
I am the emperor.

27:27.600 --> 27:29.410
I get whatever I want.

27:30.200 --> 27:31.260
I can't be happier.

27:32.000 --> 27:33.600
Do I even need your blessing?

27:33.880 --> 27:35.480
You're the ruler of a nation,

27:36.190 --> 27:37.440
but I feel you've never

27:37.440 --> 27:38.550
truly been happy.

27:43.480 --> 27:44.830
Who do you think you are?

27:45.510 --> 27:47.240
How dare you comment on me?

27:48.000 --> 27:49.330
Whether I'm happy or not

27:49.680 --> 27:51.200
is not for you to judge!

27:51.680 --> 27:52.110
Fine.

27:53.270 --> 27:54.750
Then I wish from now on,

27:55.400 --> 27:57.130
you can find joy and happiness.

28:03.790 --> 28:04.600
Feng Xiyang,

28:06.310 --> 28:07.240
give me a smile.

28:08.110 --> 28:08.830
I have never

28:08.830 --> 28:10.070
seen you smile at me.

28:13.790 --> 28:15.050
Tomorrow I will leave.

28:16.270 --> 28:17.130
And after that,

28:17.440 --> 28:18.840
we will never meet again.

28:19.690 --> 28:21.920
♪ Flying up to the clouds ♪

28:22.250 --> 28:24.840
♪ Yet the sun is hiding ♪

28:25.790 --> 28:26.520
Don't worry,

28:27.330 --> 28:28.110
I will carefully raise

28:27.360 --> 28:29.280
♪ Roaming freely ♪

28:28.110 --> 28:29.240
the child in my womb.

28:29.520 --> 28:32.870
♪ Unafraid of wind or frost ♪

28:29.960 --> 28:30.510
However,

28:31.110 --> 28:32.510
I will never let him know

28:32.510 --> 28:33.640
who his father is.

28:34.840 --> 28:36.410
♪ The wet wings ♪

28:36.930 --> 28:40.670
♪ Will carry me far away ♪

28:41.790 --> 28:42.830
No one has ever

28:42.830 --> 28:44.560
dared to speak to me like this.

28:44.750 --> 28:45.920
Too bad you met me.

28:46.290 --> 28:48.310
Whether you like it or not,

28:48.640 --> 28:49.880
after I'm gone,

28:50.350 --> 28:51.270
you'll never hear

28:51.270 --> 28:52.670
these harsh words again.

28:54.290 --> 28:58.590
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

29:03.920 --> 29:05.350
After the child is born,

29:06.240 --> 29:07.310
send me a message.

29:10.640 --> 29:11.440
No.

29:14.960 --> 29:15.510
Your Highness.

29:15.160 --> 29:15.620
[Hidden Dragon Mansion]

29:22.440 --> 29:24.070
This is non-negotiable!

29:26.830 --> 29:27.960
If you dare disobey,

29:28.640 --> 29:30.440
I will certainly send troops
to attack Susha.

29:30.440 --> 29:31.440
Are you finished?

29:32.000 --> 29:32.720
If you have anything else to say,

29:32.720 --> 29:33.750
say it all now.

29:35.070 --> 29:35.800
Feng Xiyang,

29:36.480 --> 29:37.810
listen to me carefully.

29:38.200 --> 29:39.190
To me, you are

29:39.750 --> 29:41.270
no more than a plaything.

29:42.070 --> 29:43.070
You're no different

29:43.070 --> 29:43.960
from all those women

29:43.960 --> 29:44.830
I've discarded.

29:44.830 --> 29:45.890
Do you understand?

30:11.070 --> 30:11.870
Your Majesty!

30:11.880 --> 30:12.950
Run, Your Majesty!

30:15.830 --> 30:16.720
Leave through the back door.

30:16.720 --> 30:17.580
Get lost now!

30:23.270 --> 30:23.680
Go.

30:24.520 --> 30:26.510
[To Glorify the Past, Enrich the Future]

30:31.590 --> 30:32.390
Your Majesty.

30:34.360 --> 30:35.690
Where are you two going?

30:36.720 --> 30:38.900
Tomorrow is your birthday, Your Majesty.

30:38.900 --> 30:39.810
I wish you

30:40.880 --> 30:42.010
eternal longevity,

30:42.270 --> 30:43.670
health, and prosperity.

30:48.310 --> 30:49.910
So it's really you, bastard.

30:51.070 --> 30:51.720
Which idiot taught you

30:51.720 --> 30:53.650
to give birthday wishes like that?

30:54.640 --> 30:55.270
It seems that you

30:55.270 --> 30:57.400
don't like these words, Your Majesty.

30:57.510 --> 30:58.680
But that's nothing new.

30:58.680 --> 30:59.720
Since childhood,

30:59.720 --> 31:00.590
no matter what I say,

31:00.590 --> 31:01.850
you've never liked it.

31:02.240 --> 31:04.500
Then I shall mull over a few more phrases,

31:04.590 --> 31:06.920
preparing to write them down in the future

31:08.480 --> 31:10.340
and burn them for you in the grave.

31:13.480 --> 31:14.590
You're here for me.

31:15.080 --> 31:16.810
This has nothing to do with her.

31:17.640 --> 31:18.570
Let her go first.

31:25.160 --> 31:26.300
You have no say

31:26.920 --> 31:28.310
over her life.

31:28.790 --> 31:29.890
Xia Jingshi!

31:30.350 --> 31:31.340
Are you crazy?

32:07.570 --> 32:09.480
A bastard will always be a bastard.

32:09.480 --> 32:11.010
Even if you bare your fangs,

32:11.200 --> 32:12.800
you're still just a bastard.

32:19.160 --> 32:20.200
Xia Jingshi!

32:20.510 --> 32:21.640
Stop!

32:22.350 --> 32:23.920
When you were doing evil,

32:24.880 --> 32:26.880
did you ever expect this day to come?

32:44.440 --> 32:46.100
I know very well what you want.

32:46.920 --> 32:47.920
You torture me

32:48.270 --> 32:48.880
because you want

32:48.880 --> 32:50.740
to see me beg for mercy on my knees,

32:51.830 --> 32:53.720
to see me beg you like a wretch.

32:54.790 --> 32:56.310
Keep dreaming.

32:57.850 --> 32:59.440
I, Xia Jingyan, may never have been

32:59.440 --> 33:01.300
a proper emperor for a single day.

33:01.350 --> 33:02.400
But I know

33:03.030 --> 33:04.520
that as an emperor,

33:04.750 --> 33:06.440
I must never yield.

33:09.530 --> 33:11.020
[Lasting Kinship, Through the Ages]

33:15.680 --> 33:17.440
An emperor has his pride.

33:18.070 --> 33:19.960
A sovereign has his dignity.

33:22.070 --> 33:23.720
I am the ruler of Jinxiu.

33:25.110 --> 33:26.550
If my backbone breaks,

33:27.270 --> 33:29.070
then Jinxiu's backbone breaks.

33:29.680 --> 33:31.090
My kneeling

33:32.030 --> 33:34.030
will also bring Jinxiu to its knees.

33:34.510 --> 33:35.750
Even if you kill me,

33:36.480 --> 33:37.680
you will forever remain

33:37.680 --> 33:39.650
a treacherous usurper.

33:40.070 --> 33:41.600
A bastard like you

33:41.920 --> 33:43.570
will never understand

33:43.680 --> 33:45.410
what it means to be a sovereign.

33:45.880 --> 33:47.820
Even if you cut me into pieces,

33:48.750 --> 33:50.550
you will never hear me let out

33:50.550 --> 33:51.510
a single cry

33:51.510 --> 33:53.370
of submission or a plea for mercy.

33:56.350 --> 33:57.480
Bastard.

34:09.150 --> 34:10.150
Bastard.

34:24.100 --> 34:24.820
Enough!

34:25.030 --> 34:26.170
Xia Jingshi,

34:26.260 --> 34:27.150
how much longer are you

34:27.150 --> 34:28.350
going to torture him?

34:40.880 --> 34:42.280
You're pleading for him?

34:45.880 --> 34:47.409
When he humiliated others,

34:48.280 --> 34:49.739
who ever pleaded for them?

34:50.840 --> 34:51.510
When he casually

34:51.510 --> 34:53.210
sentenced someone to death,

34:53.510 --> 34:55.440
who ever pleaded for those people?

34:56.440 --> 34:57.230
Feng Xiyang,

34:57.880 --> 34:58.920
you should know

34:59.480 --> 35:00.400
that you're pleading

35:00.400 --> 35:02.110
for a demon whose fingers are covered

35:02.110 --> 35:02.880
in blood.

35:07.320 --> 35:08.110
Feng Xiyang,

35:09.590 --> 35:10.760
give me a smile.

35:11.800 --> 35:12.860
I've never seen it.

35:14.000 --> 35:14.960
Just one smile.

35:17.440 --> 35:18.070
With your smile,

35:18.070 --> 35:19.720
I can die without regrets.

35:28.570 --> 35:32.880
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

35:34.940 --> 35:40.730
♪ I'll remember the way home ♪

35:39.920 --> 35:42.000
So your smile looks this awful.

35:43.970 --> 35:46.940
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

35:50.060 --> 35:55.680
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

35:56.570 --> 35:57.300
Xia Jingshi,

35:58.110 --> 35:59.170
what are you doing?

36:03.370 --> 36:04.540
Xia Jingshi,

36:06.030 --> 36:07.690
you want to kill me, don't you?

36:10.680 --> 36:12.610
I never thought about killing you.

36:12.920 --> 36:14.400
But your only mistake was

36:14.870 --> 36:16.110
becoming his woman.

36:22.440 --> 36:23.170
Xia Jingshi,

36:23.590 --> 36:24.540
come at me.

36:24.850 --> 36:25.460
Let her go.

36:28.800 --> 36:29.460
I beg you.

36:29.630 --> 36:31.230
I'm begging you to let her...

36:31.570 --> 36:32.210
Let her go.

36:32.770 --> 36:33.480
I beg you.

36:34.070 --> 36:34.590
Please.

36:35.070 --> 36:36.870
Didn't you claim to never yield?

36:37.070 --> 36:37.630
I beg you!

36:37.630 --> 36:38.150
Didn't you

36:38.150 --> 36:39.950
have the dignity of a sovereign?

36:40.000 --> 36:40.730
Let her go...

36:40.760 --> 36:41.320
I beg you.

36:42.550 --> 36:43.030
Please.

36:43.440 --> 36:44.640
I beg you to let her go.

36:46.070 --> 36:46.920
I am the one who should be

36:46.920 --> 36:48.180
the Emperor of Jinxiu.

36:49.440 --> 36:51.120
Let me teach you how to be one.

36:58.980 --> 37:01.160
[Lasting Kinship, Through the Ages]

37:01.710 --> 37:04.150
♪ The rain drifts endlessly ♪

37:04.710 --> 37:07.540
♪ The old dream burns the heart ♪

37:07.990 --> 37:10.140
♪ Dreams sink into ruin ♪

37:10.870 --> 37:14.250
♪ Missing the warmth of your palm ♪

37:14.630 --> 37:16.790
♪ Awaiting dusk ♪

37:17.160 --> 37:20.590
♪ Shadows take root in the mountain pass ♪

37:21.050 --> 37:26.880
♪ In just a moment, tears stained ♪

37:27.320 --> 37:29.310
♪ Amid the bustling sound
of wind and rain ♪

37:29.930 --> 37:33.600
♪ Who laughs at me,
heart cold as the desert? ♪

37:34.000 --> 37:35.690
♪ Dreams turn through a lifetime ♪

37:36.140 --> 37:39.910
♪ Who sighs for me,
enduring separations? ♪

37:40.410 --> 37:42.340
♪ Love is a trial, harsh and cold ♪

37:42.910 --> 37:45.840
♪ Who crushes the lingering pain for me? ♪

37:46.360 --> 37:51.870
♪ Clouds vanish, rain ceases, seek me ♪

37:55.600 --> 37:58.990
♪ The world is vast and far ♪

38:02.270 --> 38:04.990
♪ Time is unbearable to endure ♪

38:05.460 --> 38:08.560
♪ Lost in the wilderness ♪

38:07.320 --> 38:10.110
Xiyang, Xiyang.

38:08.990 --> 38:11.510
♪ I've been looking for you ♪

38:12.010 --> 38:14.810
♪ Even if devastation fills my eyes ♪

38:15.180 --> 38:17.760
♪ The shadows continue to sway ♪

38:18.460 --> 38:21.240
♪ The phoenix going against light ♪

38:21.720 --> 38:24.380
♪ Has been looking for a thousand miles ♪

38:24.870 --> 38:27.960
♪ As years pass, dust stirs,
stirring deep longing ♪

38:28.390 --> 38:34.440
♪ All I ask is to be together forever ♪

38:53.770 --> 38:56.700
[Lasting Kinship, Through the Ages]

38:55.700 --> 38:57.630
Your Highness, someone's coming.

39:00.110 --> 39:00.970
Your Highness.

39:05.360 --> 39:06.160
Take him away.

39:08.430 --> 39:10.390
[Lasting Kinship, Through the Ages]

39:18.230 --> 39:19.600
[Serene Abode]

39:31.000 --> 39:32.070
What time is it now?

39:38.230 --> 39:39.920
It's almost midnight, Your Majesty.

39:39.920 --> 39:41.150
It's been quite a while.

39:41.150 --> 39:42.150
The Prince of Zhennan

39:42.150 --> 39:43.610
should have made it by now.

39:43.880 --> 39:44.930
But somehow,

39:45.480 --> 39:46.190
I have

39:46.190 --> 39:47.550
a bad feeling.

39:48.550 --> 39:51.190
You haven't been resting well lately,
Your Majesty.

39:51.190 --> 39:53.390
Perhaps we should return to the palace?

39:53.590 --> 39:54.270
No,

39:54.990 --> 39:56.360
I want to see that bitch die

39:56.360 --> 39:57.520
with my own eyes.

39:57.960 --> 39:59.570
As long as she's alive,

39:59.710 --> 40:01.870
I just can't have a moment's peace.

40:07.510 --> 40:09.040
Greetings, Your Eminence.

40:09.590 --> 40:10.450
Your Eminence,

40:10.670 --> 40:13.130
is the great undertaking
about to commence?

40:13.550 --> 40:15.110
Are you all ready?

40:15.760 --> 40:17.760
Your Eminence, just give the order.

40:18.710 --> 40:21.240
We'll fulfill it
even at the cost of our lives.

40:23.290 --> 40:27.040
[Hidden Dragon Mansion]

40:33.800 --> 40:34.480
Xiyang!

40:35.590 --> 40:36.070
Xiyang!

40:37.190 --> 40:37.670
Xiyang.

40:39.070 --> 40:40.080
Brother.

40:42.780 --> 40:43.650
What happened?

40:45.360 --> 40:46.940
It was Xia Jingshi.

40:47.070 --> 40:48.810
It was Xia...

40:48.920 --> 40:50.220
Hold on, Xiyang.

40:50.280 --> 40:51.080
Hang in there.

40:51.230 --> 40:53.160
I'll take you to see the physician.

40:53.710 --> 40:55.070
Just hang in there a bit longer.

40:55.070 --> 40:56.210
Xia Jingshi

40:56.280 --> 40:58.040
killed Xia Jingyan

40:58.110 --> 41:00.010
and took Xia Jingyan's body away.

41:01.590 --> 41:03.320
H-He went that way.

41:03.670 --> 41:04.530
They just left.

41:05.230 --> 41:06.000
You save Xiyang first.

41:06.000 --> 41:07.670
I'll take people to go after him.

41:07.670 --> 41:08.280
Yixiao!

41:10.880 --> 41:11.790
Go help her.

41:11.840 --> 41:12.400
Yes.

41:13.760 --> 41:14.680
Hang on, Xiyang.

41:14.470 --> 41:16.410
[Lasting Kinship, Through the Ages]

41:19.670 --> 41:22.840
We wish His Majesty a long life

41:22.960 --> 41:24.820
with well-being and good health!

41:25.000 --> 41:28.110
We wish His Majesty good luck

41:28.190 --> 41:30.190
and longevity!

41:30.480 --> 41:33.710
We wish His Majesty boundless blessings

41:33.880 --> 41:35.480
and good health!

41:36.360 --> 41:39.480
We wish His Majesty a long life

41:39.840 --> 41:41.990
with well-being and good health!

41:42.110 --> 41:45.400
We wish His Majesty good luck

41:45.590 --> 41:47.480
and longevity!

41:48.150 --> 41:51.670
We wish His Majesty boundless blessings

41:51.880 --> 41:53.670
and good health!

41:54.280 --> 41:57.630
We wish His Majesty a long life

41:57.710 --> 41:59.590
with well-being and good health!

41:59.960 --> 42:03.000
We wish His Majesty good luck

42:03.360 --> 42:04.960
and longevity!

42:05.710 --> 42:07.800
We wish His Majesty boundless blessings.

42:07.800 --> 42:08.400
Split up and search.

42:08.400 --> 42:08.880
Okay.

42:09.030 --> 42:10.880
And good health!

42:11.670 --> 42:17.360
[Yunlai Inn]

42:12.670 --> 42:13.230
Yu Qi!

42:17.400 --> 42:18.460
Fetch a physician!

42:18.550 --> 42:19.350
-Hurry!
-Yes.

42:19.920 --> 42:20.360
Wait.

42:21.360 --> 42:22.490
Go and send a message

42:22.510 --> 42:24.280
to all Susha spies
hiding in Shengjing.

42:24.280 --> 42:26.070
Tell them to find
Fu Yixiao as soon as possible

42:26.070 --> 42:27.440
and ensure her safety at all costs.

42:27.440 --> 42:28.170
Understood.

42:32.470 --> 42:33.190
Your Majesty,

42:33.190 --> 42:34.510
the Prince of Zhennan is back.

42:34.510 --> 42:34.960
Bring him in.

42:34.960 --> 42:35.360
Yes!

42:52.920 --> 42:54.150
Greetings, Mother.

42:56.100 --> 42:57.300
Did you kill that guy?

42:57.360 --> 42:58.150
Yes, Mother.

42:58.630 --> 42:59.360
We've

42:59.590 --> 43:00.360
killed that person.
